{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13508","headline":"和徐侍郎书丛筱韵 · 蒋涣","name":"和徐侍郎书丛筱韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"中禁夕沈沈，幽篁别作林。\n色连鸡树近，影落凤池深。\n爲重凌霜节，能虚应物心。\n年年承雨露，长对紫庭阴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蒋涣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13508.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13508","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}